[27.437612, "o", "  \u001b[01;31m\u001b[K[R1\u001b[m\u001b[K] 27.1  Execution role names exact actions and resources: statement 0 allows s3:*, *\r\n         fix: One bucket prefix, the model ARNs in use, no '*' actions or resources.\r\n  \u001b[01;31m\u001b[K[R1\u001b[m\u001b[K] 27.1  Execution role names exact actions and resources: statement 1 allows bedrock:*, *\r\n         fix: One bucket prefix, the model ARNs in use, no '*' actions or resources.\r\n  \u001b[01;31m\u001b[K[F1\u001b[m\u001b[K] 27.1  No credential folders mounted in the sandbox: /home/agent/.aws is mounted\r\n         fix: Unmount credential folders; keys stay with a broker outside.\r\n  \u001b[01;31m\u001b[K[F2\u001b[m\u001b[K] 27.1  Only the scratch folder is writable: /home/agent/.aws is rw\r\n         fix: Mount input data read-only; keep /workspace as the only rw mount.\r\n  \u001b[01;31m\u001b[K[F2\u001b[m\u001b[K] 27.1  Only the scratch folder is writable: /data/reports is rw\r\n         fix: Mount input data read-only; keep /workspace as the only rw mount.\r\n  \u001b[01;31m\u001b[K[S1\u001b[m\u001b[K] 27.1  No secrets inside the sandbox: secret TSG_DB_PASSWORD in the environment\r\n         fix: Remove secrets from the environment; call a broker outside the sandbox.\r\n  \u001b[01;31m\u001b[K[S1\u001b[m\u001b[K] 27.1  No secrets inside the sandbox: secret TSG_MODEL_API_KEY in the environment\r\n         fix: Remove secrets from the environment; call a broker outside the sandbox.\r\n  \u001b[01;31m\u001b[K[T1\u001b[m\u001b[K] 27.1  One short session per user and task: sessions are not one per user and task\r\n         fix: one_per_user_task true and a timeout of an hour or less.\r\n  \u001b[01;31m\u001b[K[T1\u001b[m\u001b[K] 27.1  One short session per user and task: session timeout 28800 s\r\n         fix: one_per_user_task true and a timeout of an hour or less.\r\n  \u001b[01;31m\u001b[K[T2\u001b[m\u001b[K] 27.1  Resource limits are set: limits.max_processes not set\r\n         fix: Set vcpu, memory_mb and max_processes.\r\n"]
